{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of dimes in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805653daff0f164732e8c00ac5fb119709cebe9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> half dollars is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ce27f68767156e09398a57de798857da04b4674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad K-10 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 5K-20 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad \\frac{K-4}{5} \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad \\frac{K}{5}-4 \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"538\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dimes in one half dollar, so there are\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc175ffe499fea876bb2208b9b524af6590538d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(K-4)(5) = 5K-20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" /> dimes in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805653daff0f164732e8c00ac5fb119709cebe9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> half dollars. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a53d27d9b3277ee74927ed8daec2257efe927062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_1\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_3\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 657/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 301/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1210/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.189      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.189      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20643:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041531 and revision id 144533. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}